      "text": "How can we verify that the person who booked the\ntrip is same as the one who is starting the trip?",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How can we verify that the person who booked the\ntrip is same as the one who is starting the trip?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CAecM2ptF6M6uAnhIXCGU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7225.783849443438,
      "y": 1751.3160474868032,
      "width": 946.5636596679688,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 962404061,
      "version": 693,
      "versionNonce": 761992832,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1756905790342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KYC ID will contain the following\n    1. Personal details: Name, Age, Aadhaar ID.\n    2. Itirenary details -> Provided by the trip agency",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KYC ID will contain the following\n    1. Personal details: Name, Age, Aadhaar ID.\n    2. Itirenary details -> Provided by the trip agency",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sMRAhnfLIzkUpjqMPAtAm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7284.287033466791,
      "y": 1895.64103680565,
      "width": 1723.7818603515625,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b09",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 28968861,
      "version": 872,
      "versionNonce": 751060608,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1756905790342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What to do if the person is booking trip individually? Do we make him manually enter the itirenary?\nEither way what format should we specify for the itirenary?",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What to do if the person is booking trip individually? Do we make him manually enter the itirenary?\nEither way what format should we specify for the itirenary?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
